flowchart TD
  START([User request]) --> CLASSIFY[Orchestrator classifies intent]
  CLASSIFY -->|product question| KNOWLEDGE[Knowledge subagent]
  CLASSIFY -->|technical issue| TROUBLE[Troubleshooting subagent]
  CLASSIFY -->|account or order| ACCOUNT[Account tools subagent]
  CLASSIFY -->|risk or unresolved issue| ESCALATE[Escalation subagent]
  KNOWLEDGE --> CRITIC[Evidence critic]
  TROUBLE --> CRITIC
  ACCOUNT --> CRITIC
  ESCALATE --> CRITIC
  CRITIC --> RESPONSE[Final response and citations]
